  id: carta_003
  titulo: YouCube Business Deal
  arteCarta: {fileID: -3678532167284416163, guid: f3aa488ca793f664cb860d1376d4d4e4, type: 3}
  descricao: Ronald and Brendan run an urban exploration channel, but the revenue
    isn't enough to make ends meet. A cigarette company wants to sponsor the channel.
    Do you agree to invest as well?
  contratar:
    textoResultado: The duo signs with the cigarette company and your business. One
      host must smoke during every livestream. The partnership works for a while,
      until a cigarette butt causes a gas explosion, killing them both and ruining
      both companies' reputations.
    deltaDinheiro: -30000
    arteResultado: {fileID: 0}
  naoContratar:
    textoResultado: The duo signs only with the cigarette company. One host must
      smoke during every livestream. The partnership works for a while, until a cigarette
      butt causes a gas explosion, killing them both and ruining the sponsor's reputation.
      Since you didn't invest, your reputation remains intact.
    deltaDinheiro: 0
    arteResultado: {fileID: 0}
